1T00:00:00","JobAdName":"研发工程师(J10096)","OrgId":4040738,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.根据项目工艺，搜集相关信息，包括物料MSDS信息，反应原理，反应参考例，反应风险，危险源识别，产品技术指标，项目的职业健康风险；\n2. 根据搜集信息，设计实验方案，并填写《项目安全风险评估表》，交由评审委员会进行评审，评审委员会由研发部副经理组织；                      \n3.准备实验所需的物料，仪器设备，并检验其是否达到既定的规格要求。对操作人员进行作业培训和考核；\n4.负责编制操作规程，按照既定的步骤，有序实施实验，并做好相应记录；做好实验现场的安全措施，劳动防护；根据实验记录，进行数据整理，分析，总结，汇报；\n5.实验完成后， 将仪器设备恢复原状，确保水，电，物料处于正常状态。","Require":"1.本科及以上学历，化工、化学相关专业，精细化工方向；\n2.熟悉公司产品基础知识，操规程，危险源识别方法，环境管理知识；\n3. 工作认真、仔细、有责任感，具有一定的协调、组织和沟通能力，一定的语言表达能力，有高度的责任心；","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-08T09:30:54","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"0b421c95-5c80-44b4-aea1-dca2a395f007","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":390863967,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"工艺工程师(J10098)","OrgId":4040836,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.参与项目生产，对项目进行跟踪管理以